  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan weighs killing a righteous path Gu Immortal and replacing that person, he discards the plan because forces use methods such as life tablet Gu, soul lantern Gu, or blood rope Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "gu_soul_lantern_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Every super force and normal force has an ancestral hall. Inside, life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu are used, or even blood rope Gu. Life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu are the common pair; blood rope Gu is the rarer option.",
        "chapters": [
          1342
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ancestral-halls",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Gan Ni had been refining all sorts of blood path Immortal Gu for Giant Sun Immortal Venerable, and blood rope Immortal Gu was one of those products. Those Immortal Gu were too low ranked to suit him.",
        "chapters": [
          2246
        ],
